// Step 3: the whole verse. Voice 1: melody (and the closing tag). Voice 2: the root on beat 1 and
// a fill on beat 2, a chord tone under the held melody note. Where the melody itself sits on
// string 3 (bars 4 and 12) the bass simply rings. Bar 16: a bass walk-up A B C# into the D chord.
// Chords: D D G D | D D A A | D D7 G D | D A D (D).
\title "Amazing Grace: solo arrangement in D"
\music "Traditional"
\tempo 80
\track ("Guitar" "Gtr.") { instrument acousticguitarsteel }
\staff { score tabs }
